'''Full Transparency''' (ありのままの, ''Ari no Mama no'', "'''As I Truly Am'''") is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (M): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 20%.

==Requirement==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Full Transparency|Bounty Up (M)|Blizana|Macho Crystal Cat|jpname=ありのままの}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This [[Cat Combo|Combo]]'s Japanese name, Ari no Mama no, is a reference to "[https://youtu.be/6-dqMG-Uycg Ari no Mama de]" (ありのままで, "As I Truly Am"), the Japanese version of the song "[[wikipedia:Let It Go|Let It Go]]" from the movie ''[[wikipedia:Frozen (2013 film)|Frozen]]''.

